1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:10,666
Today we are going to
find F on the stave.

3
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:17,889
Remember F on the keyboard? Just
left of the three black keys.

4
00:00:21,489 --> 00:00:27,965
Now let's find it… on the
stave. First… the treble stave.

5
00:00:28,565 --> 00:00:31,559
The treble stave has four spaces.

6
00:00:34,559 --> 00:00:39,874
Here is a trick to remember them…
The four spaces spell a word.

7
00:00:40,474 --> 00:00:45,697
F… A… C… E.

8
00:00:48,297 --> 00:00:51,709
The spaces spell… FACE.

9
00:00:52,309 --> 00:00:57,438
The lowest space is F…
the first letter of FACE.

10
00:01:00,638 --> 00:01:02,564
Now the bass stave.

11
00:01:03,164 --> 00:01:08,711
The bass clef has two little
dots… one above, and one below.

12
00:01:11,711 --> 00:01:15,030
The line between the dots… is F.

13
00:01:18,430 --> 00:01:24,210
Two F's… one on each
stave… the same note name.

14
00:01:28,010 --> 00:01:31,282
Your turn! Look and listen.

15
00:01:31,782 --> 00:01:35,472
Which space is F… on the treble stave?

16
00:01:39,772 --> 00:01:41,094
This one.

17
00:01:42,894 --> 00:01:45,934
What word do the four spaces spell?

18
00:01:50,034 --> 00:01:51,234
FACE.

19
00:01:53,016 --> 00:01:55,592
Is this note… F?

20
00:01:59,692 --> 00:02:00,892
Yes!

21
00:02:01,728 --> 00:02:03,049
You've got it!

22
00:02:04,749 --> 00:02:06,210
Now it's your turn!

23
00:02:06,410 --> 00:02:10,333
Play Space Face and learn the spaces!

24
00:02:12,133 --> 00:02:16,793
Grown-ups, subscribe so
you never miss a Nugget.

25
00:02:16,843 --> 00:02:19,863
New ones every Wednesday and Saturday.

26
00:02:20,163 --> 00:02:22,553
See you for the next Nugget!

